          "id": "c2",
          "interaction": "fill-blank",
          "prompt": "[S3] If (k − 1)x = 3(k − 1) has infinitely many solutions, then k = ____",
          "answer": "1",
          "solution": "当 k=1 时方程化为 0=0，任意 x 都是解，故无穷多解。",
          "level": "challenge"
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "interaction": "short-text",
          "prompt": "[S3] A tank is empty. Pipe A fills it in 6 h; pipe B empties it in 9 h. Both open together; after how many hours is the tank full? (Answer as a mixed number or improper fraction.)",
          "answer": "18",
          "solution": "净速 1/6−1/9=1/18（箱／时），时间=18 小时。",
          "level": "challenge"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
